==Description== 

The [[Image:FCGear_PlanetaryGear.svg|24px]] '''FCGear PlanetaryGear''' command calculates and creates a planetary gear assembly. A live preview helps to find valid settings.

</translate>
[[Image:FCGear_PlanetaryGear_01.png|300px]] [[Image:Button_right.svg|16px|link=]] [[Image:FCGear_PlanetaryGear_02.png|300px]]
<translate>

{{Caption|Live preview in the 3D View → Finished planetary gear assembly (colors added for clarity)}}

==Usage==

# There are several ways to invoke the command:
#* Press the {{Button|[[File:FCGear_PlanetaryGear.svg|16px]] [[FCGear_PlanetaryGear|Planetary Gear Assembly]]}} button in the toolbar.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Gear → [[File:FCGear_PlanetaryGear.svg|16px]] Planetary Gear Assembly}} option from the menu.
# The '''Planetary Gear Assembly''' [[Task_Panel|Task Panel]] opens.
# Adjust the parameters and press {{Button|OK}} To finish configuration and close the Task Panel
# An assembly, a PlanetaryGear object, is created.

